      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Inversa di R19 has type: in DeSMòS collega un tipo di relazione alle relazioni intertestuali che qualifica. La proprietà originale ha come domain intro:INT11_TypeOfInterrelation e come range intro:INT3_Interrelation. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain intro:INT11_TypeOfInterrelation e come range intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Inverse of R19 has type: in DeSMòS, it relates a relation type to the intertextual relations it qualifies. The original property has domain intro:INT11_TypeOfInterrelation and range intro:INT3_Interrelation. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain intro:INT11_TypeOfInterrelation and range intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation."
      }
    ],
